<h2 class="doc-h2">Text</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The case where a placeholder will not do: "$" has to stay visible while the number is typed.
</p>
<Example Source="InputGroupText.razor"><InputGroupText /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Smaller than a standalone button, because it has to fit inside a 36px control — which is what
    <code>InputGroupButton</code>'s own size table is for.
</p>
